---

DATA — PUBLIC DOMAIN

Text:     Minchat Shai, Hebrew: the 35 Sefaria titles "Minchat Shai on ..."
          (data/sources/minchat-shai/Minchat Shai on *.json).
Source:   Sefaria (https://www.sefaria.org), via Sefaria-Export
          (https://github.com/Sefaria/Sefaria-Export) at commit
          de1d27b7e275bf29709977dff6684335eb91ef30 and the gs://sefaria-export
          bucket.
License:  Public Domain. Sefaria gives each text version a license field, and
          every version in this snapshot has the license "Public Domain"
          (recorded per title in data/sources/minchat-shai/SOURCE.json).

The JSON files are Sefaria's export files, byte for byte; SOURCE.json records
their sha256, the bucket md5 and each version's license, versionTitle and
versionSource.
